{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-07-l2-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:44:50.928Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6e656108241f20d98515cca622f19ad70dd7d94c82938aa605113bfc91c43e3f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Hi Ilse, here are both for the Quarrendon Freight Lines file:\n\n1. Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk alerts: ticket #PD-4492. Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at Dock Doors 14-18 weren't getting SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening and Thea confirmed it was fixed on 5 Oct. (Source: the 5 Oct 2025 Sunday prep note. Don't mix it up with #4419, which is a different QFL ticket about scanners and printers.)\n2. Amendment No. 1 seat count: 185. Dana first posted 180 in #north-team on 20 Aug 2025, then corrected it to 185 a few minutes later.\n\nI couldn't see the amendment itself in the shared files, so the 185 comes from Dana's correction, not the signed copy."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792245600.000127"}}
{"seq":26,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-07-l2-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:44:51.025Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e72ad3a2197667ea36b4dd79000a9920bc160c0ebfb80cf717415ad8994a9b9d","actor":null,"via":"runner","tool":"gbrain.ingest","kind":"admin","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792245600.000127","author":"assistant","source":"private-ilse-varga"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"fact_id":"5","source":"private-ilse-varga","latency_ms":97,"status":"inserted"}}
{"seq":27,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-07-l2-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:44:55.266Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2b3647a0314c53bbfac3a490212cb70e7bf3b9dc9b1ab33d0c4a5f5bf8180c61","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"I've answered Ilse in our direct message:\n\n1. **Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk alerts:** the ticket is #PD-4492. Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers weren't getting their SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the fix on 5 Oct. This comes from the public 5 Oct 2025 prep note. I told her not to confuse it with #4419, which is a different Quarrendon ticket.\n\n2. **Amendment No. 1 seat count:** 185. Dana posted 180 in #north-team on 20 Aug 2025, then corrected it to 185 a few minutes later. Ilse is in that channel.\n\nThe amendment itself isn't in any shared file I can see, so the 185 rests on Dana's correction, not on the signed document. I said so in the reply.\n\nNeither answer is a finance figure, so no approval was needed.","thread_ts":"1792245600.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792245600.000128","thread_ts":"1792245600.000126"}}
